Copyright 2026 Patrick Bartels

Country-level name pools are derived from the "name-dataset" project
(https://github.com/philipperemy/name-dataset), licensed under Apache-2.0,
which extracts aggregate name statistics from a public data source. Only
aggregate top-frequency names are used; no individual records are included.

Curated country pools (Ukraine — a dataset gap; and China — hand-curated
pinyin, replacing a low-quality dataset given-name pool) and cultural
variants (e.g. US african_american) are hand-authored and are not derived
from name-dataset.
